    <string name="setup_explain">Your wallet signs one message (twice, to check it always signs the same way). The signature makes this account\'s private keys, so the same wallet can always get back into it, here or in 0xbow\'s own Privacy Pools app. Then your wallet publishes the account\'s keys once, which costs a little gas.</string>
